    <h2 id="t-five-percent">How TTI Maps the Cosmic Budget onto Three Stages</h2>
    <p class="lede muted">The observed budget is conventionally described as baryonic matter, dark matter
      and dark energy. TTI proposes a one-to-one interpretation &mdash; completed, partial and baseline
      integration &mdash; but does not yet derive either the three categories or their measured fractions
      from its own dynamics.</p>
